// # emit-x86 int-first mixed concat
//
// Logline: Bind n to 7 and print n plus x so emit-x86 can lower an int ident plus STRING.
//
// Setup: Product path is oodac emit-x86 on this file, then as and ld. No greet.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. Bind n to 7.
//   3. Print n plus x.
//
// residual: general concat and ALU stay later.

pub fn main() {
    let n = 7;
    println(n + "x");
}
